        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BGH06, Contemporary Curved Bighorn Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brass Bighorn Curved Pull with Mitered Ends is available in an array of finishes including oil rubbed bronze, polished brass, and satin nickel. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The Contemporary Curved Bighorn Door Pull can be installed surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Just make sure that if you order back-to-back mounting, you order 2 pulls. The very modern curved handle is made from 1 inch brass tubing and comes out 4-1/2 inches at the highest point of the curve.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BGH06-specifications.gif?v=1704442282\" width=\"588\" height=\"247\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" alt=\"First Impressions BGH05 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-BGH06012</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-BGH06024</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-BGH06036</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Requires 2 pulls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Curved Bighorn Door Pull | Modern Curved Handle",
                "description": "First Impressions BGH06, Contemporary Curved Bighorn Door Pull - This Brass Bighorn Curved Pull with Mitered Ends is available in an array of finishes including oil rubbed bronze, polished brass, and satin nickel. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The Contemporary Curved Bighorn Door Pull can be installed surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Just make sure that if you order back-to-back mounting, you order 2 pulls. The very modern curved handle is made from 1 inch brass tubing and comes out 4-1/2 inches at the highest point of the curve.",
